From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 15:50:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: glymur: Clear GUSB3PIPECTL.DEPOCHANGE on
 Type-C DWC3s

GUSB3PIPECTL.DEPOCHANGE reads as set on these controllers, and Linux
leaves it set unless told otherwise. With it set, the controller delays
the PHY power state change when the SuperSpeed link enters U1, U2 or U3.

When the SuperSpeed port of a Type-C controller is tunnelled through the
USB4 host router, that power state handshake is with the router's USB3
adapter instead of the combo PHY, and with DEPOCHANGE set the tunnelled
link does not leave U2 or U3. A hub behind a USB4 dock entered U2 and
never returned to U0, so control transfers to it timed out, and resuming
it from U3 ended in a disconnect and re-enumeration. With the bit
cleared, U2 exit and U3 resume across the tunnel work.

Set snps,dis-del-phy-power-chg-quirk, which clears the bit, on the three
Type-C controllers, all of which sit behind USB4-capable QMPPHYs. The
setting applies to the port whether or not it is tunnelled. Native USB3
links were seen working with the bit set and with it cleared, and
nothing outside USB4 is known to need it. The platform's Windows driver
clears the same bit on these three controllers.

Assisted-by: Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur.dtsi | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur.dtsi
index 10d29f92fda..cecb9b7b4f1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur.dtsi
@@ -4636,6 +4636,7 @@ &mc_virt SLAVE_EBI1 QCOM_ICC_TAG_ALWAYS>,
 			tx-fifo-resize;
 			snps,dis_u2_susphy_quirk;
 			snps,dis_enblslpm_quirk;
+			snps,dis-del-phy-power-chg-quirk;
 
 			usb-role-switch;
 			wakeup-source;
@@ -4724,6 +4725,7 @@ &mc_virt SLAVE_EBI1 QCOM_ICC_TAG_ALWAYS>,
 			tx-fifo-resize;
 			snps,dis_u2_susphy_quirk;
 			snps,dis_enblslpm_quirk;
+			snps,dis-del-phy-power-chg-quirk;
 
 			usb-role-switch;
 			wakeup-source;
@@ -4812,6 +4814,7 @@ &mc_virt SLAVE_EBI1 QCOM_ICC_TAG_ALWAYS>,
 			tx-fifo-resize;
 			snps,dis_u2_susphy_quirk;
 			snps,dis_enblslpm_quirk;
+			snps,dis-del-phy-power-chg-quirk;
 
 			usb-role-switch;
 			wakeup-source;
